[statement]
The constraint a name's single candidate states moves a package installed
already: `so:r`'s one candidate `r` needs `so:n`, whose one candidate `n`
needs `base=2`, and `base` 1 is installed. `base` is required with
`base=2` before `n` is installed, and apk upgrades it. The shape of
`reduced/lua5-4-luautf8-upgrades-an-installed-ncurses-terminfo-base`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:so:r

P:r
V:1
p:so:r=1
D:so:n

P:n
V:1
p:so:n=1
D:base=2

P:base
V:2

[installed]
P:base
V:1

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade base 1 2
install n 1
install r 1
install app 1
